    (12319, 10210, 10174, NULL, 'Med', 'Disable Delete if Bond/Deals are in use', 'If a DealId or BondId is in use, then don''t allow the user to delete it.  This is prevent orphaned comments.

''IN USE'' means, for example, Comments, Trade Blotter, etc.  

